       "好的；没问题"
      ]
     ],
     "x": [
      [
       "All right, let's go.",
       "好，我们走。"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "w": "thank you very much",
     "t": "句型",
     "s": [
      [
       "",
       "非常感谢"
      ]
     ],
     "x": [
      [
       "Thank you very much!",
       "非常感谢！"
      ]
     ]
    }
